## Bathing customs
{% if get_global_value("OBDC_NormBathing") == 1 %}
Across Skyrim, bathing nude in rivers, streams, lakes, hot springs, and communal bathing pools where others can see is ordinary Nordic custom, not shocking or immodest.
{% endif %}
